    LLM: 'Game: Vatra. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Vatra ('Fire') is a card-passing party game for 3-13 players. Each player gets 4 cards (one rank per player). Pass cards to collect four-of-a-kind. First to four-of-a-kind calls 'Vatra!' Loser (last without) gets punishment: winner shuffles deck, loser names a card, cards flipped â€” each suit before that card = specific physical penalty.",
    objective: "Collect four cards of the same rank (four-of-a-kind). Be the first to slam your hand and yell 'Vatra!'; the last player to do so loses the hand and receives a suit-based physical punishment.",
